        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.16.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kurug 16:31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maanu ekaba neesisana nk'ensigo z'omugusa gw'enkumba ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.16.13+EXO.16.14+EXO.16.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kurug 16:13-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abantu baagendaga bagisorooza, bagisa harubengo rundi bagihonda omu nsekuro, bagitogosa omu binaga, bagikoramu keeki, ekaba n'enura nka keeki ezinyakucumbisiibwe amagita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekiro orume oburwagwaga omu rukande, maanu yagweranamuga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa akahurra abantu nibateera empamo omu nganda zaabo, buli muntu ali ha mulyango ogw'Eheema ye, ekiniga kya MUKAMA kyayaka muno. Musa nukwo kubiihirwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yakaguza MUKAMA ati: “Kiki ekikukoleze kubi omwiru wawe? Kandi habwaki otangiriire embabazi, iwe kuntaho obulemeezi bw'abantu abo boona? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu abo boona, ninyowe natwaire enda yabo? Ninyowe nabazaire? Nikyo orukungambira ngu: ‘Bahimbire omu kifuba kyawe, nk'omulezi oku ahimba omwana arukwonka,’ mbahikye omunsi ei waraganiize kuha baisenkurubo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyowe enyama ey'okuha abantu banu boona ngiihe nkaha? Dora nibandirirra nibagamba bati: ‘Tuhe enyama tulye.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyowe omuntu omu, tindukusobora kurolerra abantu banu boona, obulemeezi bumpinguraine ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu oraaba noogonza, kunkora oti, hakire onyite hati, baitu obu oraaba nongirra embabazi oleke kuncanza.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA yagambira Musa ati: “Omu bakuru ba Isirairi, nsorooleza abasaija nsanju iwe aba orukumanya ngu nubo bakuru b'abantu kandi balemi baabo, obaleete omu Heema ey'okutangatanganiramu, nuho beemerre na iwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndaasirimuka mbaze na iwe, kandi ndakukeehyaho omwoyo ogurukwikara na iwe ngubahe; nabo nukwo bakukonyere ha bulemeezi bw'abantu, oleke kubwetweka wenka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ogambire abantu ngu: ‘Mweyeze inywenka habw'ekiro kya nyenkya, nimwija kulya enyama, habwokuba MUKAMA ahuliire nimumulirirra nimugamba muti: “N'oha araatuha enyama tukalya? Habwokuba Misiri tukaba tuli kurungi.” Nahabweki, MUKAMA araabaha enyama mulye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timwagirye ekiro kimu rundi bibiri, rundi ebiro bitaano rundi makumi abiri, baitu nimwija kugirya ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okumara okwezi kwona okuhika obu erakabatama, habwokuba mwehakaine MUKAMA arukwikara na inywe, mwarra omumaiso ge nimugamba muti: “Kiki ekyatwihire omunsi Misiri?”’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yagamba ati: “Abantu ndukwikaramu, omuhendo gw'abaserikale nibahika emitwaro nkaaga, iwe ogambire ngu: ‘Ndaabaha enyama balye okwezi kwona,’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kubamara oraabaitira amagana g'embuzi n'ag'ente rundi orasorooza encu zoona ez'omunyanja?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA yakaguza Musa ati: “Omukono gwa MUKAMA gugufuhaire? Hati eki ngambire, obu kiraaba kiri kyamazima rundi ky'ebisuba oraakirora.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bakuru b'abantu nibaranga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yagenda yagambira abantu byona MUKAMA ebi agambire, kandi yasorooza abasaija nsanju ab'omu bakuru b'abantu, yabeemereza bayehinguliriza Eheema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo MUKAMA yasirimuka omu kicu yababaliza. Yakeehyaho Musa omwoyo ogwaikaraga na uwe yaguha abakuru abo nsaanju, obu batungire omwoyo baranga ebirukugenda kubaho, kandi batongere kuranga obundi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasaija babiri, omu ibara lye, Eridaadi, n'ondi Medaadi, bakaba batali omukitebe, bakaba basigaire omu rukande, bakaba bali omu abo abaahandiikirwe baitu bakaba batagiire omu Heema, nabo batunga omwoyo, baarangirra omu rukande. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omusigazi yairuka yagambira Musa ati: “Eridaadi na Medaadi nibarangirra omu rukande.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Yoswa mutabani wa Nuuni omuheereza wa Musa, omu hali abasaija abaakomerwemu, yagamba ati: “Mukama wange Musa batange.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu Musa yagarukamu ati: “Nongirra ihali? Ha! Kakuba abantu ba MUKAMA boona babaire barangi, MUKAMA akabaha omwoyo gwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo Musa n'abakuru b'abantu ba Isirairi baagarukire omu rukande.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA naatweka entiikalya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo aho naaho MUKAMA yatweka omuyaga ogwaihire entiikalya ha nyanja, gwazireeta nihurrukira omu mwanya gw'ebigere bisatu kuruga ha itaka, zaagwa omu rukande zarwehinguliriza mairo na mairo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyamusana egi yoona, ekiro kyona n'ekiro ekyahondiireho, abantu baasorooza entiikalya; ogu ayakizire kusorooza nke, akasorooza kiloguraamu rukumi; baazanikaga okwehinguliriiza orukande. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyama obu ekaba ekyali omu kanwa, MUKAMA yabiihiriirwa muno abantu, yabaisa ebidanda by'amaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habweki ekiikaro eki kyayetwa Kiburosi-hatava, habwokuba oku, abantu ab'omukoijo nuho baaziikirwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu baaruga Kiburosi-hatava, baagenda Elize-rosi, nuho baikara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
